WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,110 --> 00:00:05,470
This kid is too cute

2
00:00:05,470 --> 00:00:06,750
Captain Zhuang, this is your son

3
00:00:06,750 --> 00:00:09,670
If you have bad eyesight, go and admire the glasses. These are yours, my son.

4
00:00:09,670 --> 00:00:10,950
You actually have a son

5
00:00:10,950 --> 00:00:12,830
Xiao Shen didn’t even hear you mention it

6
00:00:12,830 --> 00:00:13,950
In order to protect myself before

7
00:00:13,950 --> 00:00:15,710
I deliberately said there are three people living in the house

8
00:00:15,710 --> 00:00:17,940
Actually, it’s just me and Momomuzi.

9
00:00:17,940 --> 00:00:19,260
So that's it

10
00:00:19,260 --> 00:00:21,540
No wonder you never let us see her

11
00:00:21,540 --> 00:00:23,140
Captain Zhuang, Qiao Qian is happy

12
00:00:23,140 --> 00:00:25,290
These should be used when going on missions

13
00:00:25,290 --> 00:00:37,670
Thank you. I just need some food.

14
00:00:37,670 --> 00:00:39,030
My appetite is so good today

15
00:00:39,030 --> 00:00:39,990
Eat some more

16
00:00:39,990 --> 00:00:45,400
I made an appointment so quickly

17
00:00:45,400 --> 00:00:46,920
Have you asked your mother for her opinion?
